## Files

{% if st.kind == "s3" %}
The app keeps the files of the file fields in an S3-compatible service:
Amazon S3, Cloudflare R2, MinIO, and others. Set the bucket in
`{{ st.bucket_env }}`, the region in `{{ st.region_env }}`, and for a service that is not
Amazon S3 its URL in `{{ st.endpoint_env }}`. The keys are in `{{ st.access_key_env }}`
and `{{ st.secret_key_env }}`; without them, the AWS SDK uses the AWS configuration
