{% endfor %}
{% for m in mention_plans(definition) %}
| `@mention` | A new mention in `{{ m.name }}` of a {{ m.entity }} | The users that the text mentions for the first time | You are mentioned in {record}. |
{% endfor %}

- The bell in the top bar shows the count of the unread notices of the
