{% if shares %}
## Secret links

A user that may change a record of these pages makes a secret link of
it with the button "Share". A guest opens the link without a sign-in,
and sees the record without the actions. The pages of the links are in
`app/(shared-links)/`, without the app shell, and the search engines do
not index them.

| Page | Path of the links |
| ---- | ----------------- |
{% for share in shares.values() %}
| `{{ share.page }}` | `{{ share.shared_path }}` |
{% endfor %}

- The table `share_links` keeps the SHA-256 hash of each token, and a
  record has one link at most. The token shows one time only.
- A new link stops the old link, and a revoke stops the link. A link
  does not expire.

{% endif %}
